<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Aug 18.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Aug 18.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain</p>
<p>trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Southampton asa 83.50/84.00</p>
<p>Tilbury asa 83.00/84.00/84.50/85.00</p>
<p>Avon range Sep 86.50 Oct/Dec 91.50/91.25</p>
<p>West Norfolk Sep 86.50</p>
<p>Norfolf/Suffolk Oct/Dec 91.50/91.25</p>
<p>East Anglia asa 82.00/83.00/84.00/85.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire this week 85.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Suffolk/Essex asa 76.00 Sep 81.00 Oct/Dec 86.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk asa 77.00 Sep 81.00 Oct/Dec 86.00</p>
<p>Avon range Oct/Dec 86.00</p>
</text>
